===Etymology 1===
From {{etyl|fro|en}} {{term|tartre|lang=fro}}, from {{etyl|ML.|en}} {{term|tartarum|lang=la}}, from {{etyl|gkm|en}} {{term|τάρταρον|lang=grc}}, probably from {{etyl|ar|en}}{{rfscript|und|sc=Arab}}.

====Noun====
{{en-noun|~}}

# A [[red]] [[compound]] [[deposited]] during [[wine]] [[making]]; mostly [[potassium]] [[hydrogen]] [[tartrate]] - a source of [[cream of tartar]].
# A [[hard]] [[yellow]] [[deposit]] on the [[teeth]].

